cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "StackRates hosting price index"
abstract: "Daily list prices for VPS and cloud server plans, each read from the provider's own pricing page or price API, with read date and source link per row; separate columns for IPv4 fees, VAT basis and prepaid terms; a dated log of list-price changes; and a year-on-year comparison against Wayback Machine captures from around October 2025."
authors:
  - name: "StackRates (First State Growth LLC)"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://stackrates.ai/data/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/firststategrowth/vps-prices"
keywords:
  - VPS
  - cloud computing
  - hosting prices
  - price index
  - IPv4
  - open data
date-released: 2026-10-14
